  unitName: Angel
  unitId: 50050
  unitNumber: 75
  description: A humanoid with pure-white wings on its back. They are so submissive
    to the gods that they have nearly no individuality. They spend most of their
    time worshiping the gods, but they're not pure pacifists. They will wield their
    swords relentlessly against any who are recognized as the gods' enemies. They
    also devote themselves fully to anyone they consider a friend, making them very
    loyal allies.
  summonDesc: Do you need me?<br>I can sense your wish.<br>I will lend you my power.
  fusionDesc: Let us pray together.<br>My faith is my strength.
